  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Increased high‑level and sustained bilateral diplomatic engagement reduces the likelihood of escalatory political moves and public confrontation, directly lowering international political tensions that threaten energy routes and contracts.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
