  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher‑level, sustained US–China diplomatic engagement sustains operational deconfliction and joint pressure channels (e.g., information sharing, coordinated naval escorts and diplomatic pressure on Tehran), which reduces successful Houthi attacks and thus maritime disruption.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
