  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising mutual strategic trust reduces perceived supply‑risk and risk premia in wholesale markets, prompting traders and buyers to scale back precautionary bids and insurance costs, putting downward pressure on diesel spot prices.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_strategic_compe</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
