  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising bilateral strategic trust increases willingness by Washington and Beijing to intervene diplomatically and to restrain or publicly censure proxies, lowering the likelihood that localized incidents involving Iran/Houthis will spiral into broader reciprocal escalation.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_strategic_compe</data>
