  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Commercial pressure drives firms to rapidly productize and export low‑cost autonomy and guidance stacks (flight-control, vision, navigation) that are repurposed by Houthis and other proxies into larger, more frequent anti-ship/drone swarm attacks, increasing maritime disruption.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
