  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Stronger regulatory attention and stricter export controls on dual‑use AI systems reduce legal transfer channels and commercial availability of autonomy/targeting software to non-state actors, lowering their ability to conduct precision kinetic attacks.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_ai_race_and_gover</data>
  <data key="d40">middle_east_iran_houthis</data>
