<edge source="global_energy_supply_sho::crossborder_trade_flow" target="middle_east_iran_houthis::maritime_disruption_leve" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher volumes of diesel and distillates transiting chokepoints (e.g., Bab al‑Mandeb/Red Sea) increase the number of vulnerable commercial targets and transit interactions, raising incentives and opportunities for Houthi interdiction and thereby increasing maritime disruption.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
  <data key="d40">middle_east_iran_houthis</data>
</edge>
