  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher volumes and reliability of cross-border shipments reduce transit bottlenecks and delays for physical delivery of weapons and munitions into and around the conflict zone, increasing the rate and volume of transfers.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
