  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained drops in diesel and distillate shipments raise transport disruptions and variability in delivery times, directly degrading the robustness and recoverability of cross-border manufacturing supply chains for autos, semiconductors and batteries.</data>
