  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising diesel prices make seizing fuel, extorting shippers, or attacking fuel infrastructure materially more lucrative, incentivizing additional Houthi kinetic operations against tankers, terminals, and supply routes.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
