  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising energy-related geopolitical tensions prompt authorities to tighten export licensing and broaden controls on equipment and technologies deemed useful to an adversary, increasing overall export-control stringency toward the other side.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
